{"unit_id":"xuanyuanluoxue__computer-use-vision#card-zh","repo":"xuanyuanluoxue/computer-use-vision","commit":"9bbbaeab3e88e19148d805b4b40d4b307b9068a0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Computer Use Vision 是面向 Windows 的 DSH 插件，为缺少多模态能力的 agent 提供屏幕观察和桌面输入。它注册视觉识屏、鼠标点击与拖动、键盘输入、滚动和应用技巧查询工具，并加载配套 skill。用户可先截屏询问界面内容和坐标，再执行操作或查询已记录的应用技巧。适合需要让 DSH 处理 Windows 桌面任务的场景；视觉分析需配置兼容 OpenAI 格式的视觉 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:59-97","src/tools.ts:23-56","src/tools.ts:240-275"]}
{"unit_id":"xuanyuanluoxue__computer-use-vision#card-en","repo":"xuanyuanluoxue/computer-use-vision","commit":"9bbbaeab3e88e19148d805b4b40d4b307b9068a0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Computer Use Vision lets DSH agents see and operate Windows desktops. It registers screenshot analysis, mouse and keyboard input, scrolling, and application tips, plus a skill. Agents can request screen descriptions and coordinates before acting. Screen analysis needs a compatible vision API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:59-97","src/tools.ts:23-56","src/tools.ts:240-275"]}
