{"unit_id":"xuanyuanluoxue__computer-use-vision#feature-screen-vision","repo":"xuanyuanluoxue/computer-use-vision","commit":"9bbbaeab3e88e19148d805b4b40d4b307b9068a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Computer Use Vision 的功能「屏幕识别」：截取全屏或指定标题的窗口，并将截图交给视觉模型生成文字描述；调用 computer-see 时提供问题，也可指定窗口标题。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:23-56","src/windows-driver.ts:68-80","assets/scripts/see.ps1:21-35"]}
